WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.650
So it's you?

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.230
The one who's been destroying my students?

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.320
So we meet at last.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.030
Dairo Keisen.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.360
I know you've got someone behind you.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.950
You're not good enough to beat us.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.450
Us?

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.540
Ohki.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.750
Go ahead and play with him.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.420
Yes, Professor.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:28.790
I see.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:34.260
Now then. Rebuild Training is now in session.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.480
#06 Path of Light

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.770
Sakura.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:14.860
Are you back?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.870
Where am I?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.700
This is my place.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.580
I'm not going to hurt you.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.120
Don't worry.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.160
I think I remember.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.250
Teruto found you passed out in front of his tent.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.050
Then he brought you here.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.210
Thanks, Teruto.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.920
It was no big deal.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.840
What happened to you?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.550
I got destroyed in a Rebuild Battle.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:47.060
You got destroyed? Who was your opponent?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.020
You're the last person I'd want to tell.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.440
My name is Sakura, got it?

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.190
At this point, it's not worth keeping it from me.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.610
I'm not going to pry into your affairs.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.780
I don't know any more than you do.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.410
Um, both of you?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.370
I guess that's it.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.710
I was facing the challengers I've been chasing.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.670
Have you heard of the faction
formed at Neo Kyoto University?

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.010
Yes. We've even been to their hideout.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.640
In the student union.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:28.520
The leader of the faction is Dairo Keisen,
a professor at the university.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.520
NEO KYOTO UNIVERSITY PROFESSOR LIST

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.230
DAIRO KEISEN. DEPARTMENT OF WITCHCRAFT
ALSO KNOWN AS THE CARD PROFESSOR

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.600
This guy?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.230
Card Professor.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.860
Keisen wouldn't fight me himself at first,
and sent his students instead.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.780
You can send all the scrubs you want,
but you still can't beat me.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:52.210
I've got all the data I need.
From now on, I'll be lecturing you myself.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.670
Call.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:59.340
Keisen had been watching my battles,
and by then he could read my moves.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.130
No way.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.390
Have you heard the rumors about them
kidnapping people from the outer district?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.260
Could it be...

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.970
It's true. Keisen has been experimenting on people.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.140
Behind him, there's—

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.440
Naomitsu.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.810
We'll make that villain sorry.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:22.490
I'm in. If we can take Keisen down,
all those key chips will be mine.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.570
So we're avenging Naomitsu?

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.790
Does this mean, we're all on the same team?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.250
This is the lab?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.340
You sure this is the right one?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.710
The directionally challenged can keep quiet. See?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.670
NEO KYOTO UNIVERSITY
WITCHCRAFT MEDICINE RESEARCH LAB

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.220
Where's Naomitsu?

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:49.850
Since they've already seen his face,
he's standing by and will join us later.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.770
So, we'll pretend to be tourists
and sniff around this lab.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.560
We'll rescue all the captives.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.980
MEDICINE AND WITCHCRAFT
COME FROM THE SAME SOURCE

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.190
You're the students that asked for a tour?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.940
I'm the director of this lab.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.160
My name is Dairo Keisen. Nice to meet you.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.870
You're the Card Professor?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:08.370
Hey!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.410
Master!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.200
Sorry, he's a huge fan of yours and got nervous.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.660
Card Professor is fine.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:20.340
If this nickname got me to discover
Witchcraft Medicine, so be it.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.630
Someone please bring some coffee.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.050
Thank you so much.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.640
Oh, I...

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.270
I'm sorry.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.230
It's fine.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.730
I'll clean up here,
so you three can go look around the lab.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.020
I'll have someone guide you.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.480
All right.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.660
You there. Wipe down that table.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:02.920
This lab is one of few in Neo Kyoto that
is authorized to research Hikidashi Magic.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:07.760
The King has placed restrictions
on information in this field.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:12.850
We're also unique in learning about applying
the magical power of cards to medicine.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:17.390
Build-Divide's hidden power isn't just about fighting.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.560
That's our way of looking at it.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.440
Hey, where's Sakura?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.860
Oh, she just headed to the ladies' room.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.740
Did she really?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.910
Maybe she lost her way.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.740
She would never lose her way.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.410
What?

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.080
Stay down.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.500
Let's go, Hiyori.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.460
Wait, first let me...

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.920
Naomitsu.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.170
Sakura's gone?

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.550
It seems like she got captured.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.640
What was she thinking?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.640
She might have got abducted with the others.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.640
We're going to find them.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.100
Right. But where could they be?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.270
I'm moving on.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:01.600
Hey! Master, you can't just
wander around on your own.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.280
My path.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.210
Wow!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.670
Who would think of a basement like this?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:28.170
No matter how you look at it,
this isn't a typical lab, is it?

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.890
What are you doing?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.390
No one else is going to open it.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.060
What's all this?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.400
Who knows?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:49.280
My guess is they're researching
the effects of magic on human bodies.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.400
On the people they abducted, yeah?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.530
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.370
Professor Keisen.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.040
<i>I have taken your friend into custody.</i>

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.830
<i>If you don't want her to get hurt, don't resist.</i>

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.750
What should we do?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.750
It's come to this.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.920
Here's our only option.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.590
Run!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:17.720
Whoa!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.930
There's more of them.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.190
This is bad.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.560
Hiyori. Naomitsu.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.600
Yes, Master?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.020
Let's split up here.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:30.820
Hey. Don't tell me you're planning
to take on all these guys by yourself?

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.400
That would be dangerous.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.700
No. I'm leaving them to you so I can move on.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:36.240
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.210
Damn him.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.330
How could you do this, Master!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:56.470
Um, I just came here for the tour.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:01.180
You're the girl with the special body
I've been told about, right?

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.140
What are you talking about?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.270
The data doesn't lie.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.360
Your special body...

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.860
...is a valuable test subject.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.250
Hey. There you are.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.080
Teruto.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.000
I warned you, no?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.090
Do you not care what happens to this girl?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.710
Battle me.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.970
I see. You're another challenger.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.180
You may be the Card Professor, but I won't lose.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.020
You're just going to ignore me? Whatever.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.230
Card Professor?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:50.480
There's nothing I despise more
than being called by that name.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.980
Everyone that mocks me says the same thing.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.990
That Witchcraft Medicine is a raving lie
created by the Card Professor.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.910
I think it's cool actually. Card Professor.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:04.750
Fine. I'll give you a special lecture.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.790
What now?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.710
Hey now.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.420
What is this?

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.840
Confirming request for Rebuild Battle.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.590
Please bet your key chips.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.390
Eleven chips. All in.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:28.600
What? Even though I'm going to win?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.860
Fine. I'm betting all five of mine. All in.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.820
Rebuild established.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.610
Call.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.530
Rebecca.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.330
Call.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.450
Bloom.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:53.090
I see. So you're the Bloom user in that report.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.510
Now let's begin.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.050
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.850
Teruto's sustained no damage up to this turn.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:07.180
Not that Keisen is doing much anyway.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:13.560
I'm going to become the King,
and use Witchcraft Medicine to change the world.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:19.150
Defying the seething dust,
warrior wolf and leader of villains.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.570
Accept.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.660
Rebecca, Fail Shooter.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.960
Territory. Build Arise.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.960
Underground Armory...

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.670
...Arsenal Fort.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.300
So this is Keisen's Territory.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.100
Using Rebecca to attack the player.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:49.980
Using her ability to draw one card
and discard another.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:53.440
A card discarded by a brilliant man like me.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.860
That's how I see mediocre people like you.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.280
Fire, Rebecca.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.320
Take this.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:07.030
Drawing one Shot Trigger, Field Repair Arming card.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:12.040
End Phase. Since Rebecca is at rest,
I'm drawing one card.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:16.130
This Ace allows him to draw two cards
each turn just by attacking.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.500
Got to take her down soon.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.050
No attack from Mahulena?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.680
This Mahulena will soon be needed.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.140
End of turn.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:31.350
Bring it on. I'll lecture you about defeat.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.350
I don't need anyone to lecture me.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.280
Sending all living beings into chaos.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.820
Repeating death and rebirth.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.410
Accept.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.490
Bloom, Soul Wager.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.080
Territory. Build Arise.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.750
Casino of Fate.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.460
Activating ability.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.130
Just like the data said. What a stupid way to fight.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:02.880
Just like the data said?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.470
A big deduction from victory, no?

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.970
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.020
Removing six cards from the Cemetery.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:15.520
Accept Rizome.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.730
Using Rizome to attack Rebecca.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.730
Just like the report said.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.650
Using Mahulena to block the attack.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:28.320
Using Bloom to revive a high fire power unit,
then eliminate the troublesome enemy.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.450
This is your specialty, yes?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.700
Wait, how?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:38.630
My students were among the challengers
you've battled with up until now.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:43.210
I had them submit reports on
any enemies I should be aware of.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.550
Rebuild isn't just straight up battling.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.680
You must have a rational approach.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:56.310
Sure. This is going to be a showdown between
your great lecture and my gamble.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.070
Blast away.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.190
Brute Jamming.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.240
Don't give us any trouble.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.330
What should we do?

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.330
Step back, twerp. It's dangerous.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.330
Take this!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.080
Crap.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.250
I can fight too.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.090
Let's do this.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.970
Now you're talking.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.600
Teruto has six lives, but Keisen still has nine.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.480
Bloom was taken down, but Rebecca is alive.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.070
My turn. Draw.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.400
Here comes another attack from Keisen.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.320
Accept.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.280
Rosa, GPM-084 Giga Command Manipulator.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.750
Using Rosa's ability to discard my entire hand.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.670
Drawing one more card than the number discarded.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:04.840
The more incompetent people I abuse,
the stronger I get.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.170
I've drawn four cards this turn.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.640
With this, Arsenal Fort's ability is activated.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.470
From these four cards,
the damage inflicted totals fifteen thousand.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.100
Target, Rizome.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:25.070
The more cards he draws,
the more damage he inflicts.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.980
Even Rizome just went down.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.070
Now your field is completely empty.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.240
Using Rosa to launch a Two-Hit Attack.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.620
Three at once.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.330
Shot Trigger.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.750
Field Repair Arming. Drawing one card.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.840
Using Rebecca to attack the player.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.680
You're down to two lives.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:56.760
After this battle, I'll turn you into
one of my basement test subjects.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.770
That will only happen if I lose, right?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.230
My turn. Activating Casino of Fate's ability.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.610
Buster Cards, zero.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:08.730
He guessed right.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.570
Destroying Rosa.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.200
You miserable gambler.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.540
Now, come back to me. Accept, Bloom.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.250
Using Bloom's ability to remove
six cards from the Cemetery.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.090
Sending Endive, Mad Bishop to the field.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.000
Using Endive to attack the player.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.510
My turn.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:39.310
I can't believe how foolish you teenagers are.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.650
You incompetent students should
be happy to be used by me.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:48.020
Like discarded cards in battles and research.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.030
You sure are arrogant.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.400
I wish your followers could hear you now.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:57.580
It's much better to be used by me
than lead an empty life.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:58.490
Get lost.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.540
Now then. Using Mahulena to—

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.580
Not quite.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.130
I removed Endive when she was destroyed.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:10.300
I can play one Command Card
from my opponent's Cemetery.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.260
Command. Large Ballistic Missile Despair.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.510
Destroying Mahulena.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.470
I'll end this lecture with my next turn.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:20.930
Teruto.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.730
There won't be a next turn for you.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.900
I'm staking everything on my turn now.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:30.610
But I have seven lives.
You think in one turn you can...

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.110
All in.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.740
Command. One Night Nightmare.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.570
Accept. Rosa from my opponent's Cemetery.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.160
Using the ability to discard my entire hand.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.250
Drawing three and activating the second ability.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.290
By discarding three cards, Rosa gains one hit.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.750
If you're such a smart professor,
you know what this means, right?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.170
Now. Removing six cards from the Cemetery.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:56.340
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.430
Come back to life. Endive.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:02.680
A combo based on his opponent's cards.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.560
But even if you combine two units,
the hit will be five.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.360
Unless you get three Bursts,
you can't defeat me now.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:13.480
I've only seen five of your
Buster Cards during this battle.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.110
The odds aren't bad.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.740
I'm going to follow my own path.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.830
Using Rosa to launch a Three-Hit Attack.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:28.040
Shot Trigger. Blue Burst.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.760
Five thousand damage isn't enough to stop him.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.170
Fire. Rosa.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.180
If Shot Trigger shows up one more time!

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.550
Let's go, Professor.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.100
Go Teruto!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.680
This is where...

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.890
...the real fun begins.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.730
All right.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:49.350
Come on.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:52.820
Come on.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.320
Come on.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.360
There it is!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:02.030
Impossible!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.490
I just won this gamble.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.960
If I become the King, everyone will be saved.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.920
Except you can't even save yourself.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.880
Using Endive to attack the player.

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.770
I'm taking the data with me.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.270
Hold up. One more time!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.480
Now that you've lost all your key chips,
there won't be a next time for you.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:40.400
No! I still have chips from my students. So—

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.200
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.490
The terminal for in-house announcements.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.290
I secretly extracted it before the battle.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:52.330
I streamed your wretched thoughts all across the lab.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.800
I doubt there's anyone left to give you a hand.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.300
No. Way.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.260
You sure are amazing, you know?

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:09.140
Sorry for mistaking you for one of those
Department of Sorcery people.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.730
Is that so?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.770
I'll rescue you next time, got it?

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.560
Hey. Master is my Master.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.020
I won't just hand him to you.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.190
I'm not trying to steal him.

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:23.820
You say that, but you're planning
to snatch him anyway. Dirty thief.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.370
Who are you calling a cat? I'm a lion.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.280
Lions are in the cat family anyway!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.780
Teruto.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.250
I was happy when you rescued me.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:35.170
But don't you think you could've
acted a little more worried?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.300
You're always looking out for me.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:44.050
So...

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.890
I was worried about you.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.640
Also you owe me some bread.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:03.320
Right. Thanks.

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:41.170
Yes.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Looks like it's over, Keisen.</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:45.510
Higuma.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:48.430
I can still be of use to you. So—

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.510
<i>No. I'm done with you.</i>

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:59.230
<i>I'll become the King,
and establish Witchcraft Medicine.</i>

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:01.940
<i>Everyone in the world will acknowledge me.</i>

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:11.200
Hey, stop. I'm the Card Professor. Stop!

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:21.540
So you were connected to Keisen after all.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:25.960
Mario Higuma.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.970
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.890
It's the sea. The sea, the sea!

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.060
A swimsuit event for idols, I hear.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.140
You guys. Thank you for coming!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.980
#07 Ah! Vous dirai-je, Mer
